      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORMTIDE (2) registered a strong performance last start when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 2280m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Good enough to take out a race like this. ROCK HAMMER (1) finished third at this track two runs ago then settled back and failed to figure at his latest appearance over 1780m at this track, beaten 11 metres into seventh. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a similar line up and he is capable of a much better performance. MY ULTIMATE CARTER (7) is better than his last-start eighth over 1660m at Albion Park. A PERFECT DANCE (9) is worth some thought after her last-start fourth over 1780m at this track on September 23. Each way value.",
